    "detailed_description": "You arrive in the village at time of onset of a thunderstorm and in your attempts to find shelter from weather you realize that something is wrong...<br>The thunderstorm never begins, and the village is invaded by alien creatures.<br><br>You have to fight back with a shotgun and free the village. To do this, you have to go through abandoned houses and structures,<br>bypass traps, fight alien creatures and the main boss.<br><br>Don't forget to collect ammo for numerous battles and pick up the right things. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594340/extras/886beab18009e14b3d795e45bc883538.poster.avif?t=1684870587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594340/extras/886beab18009e14b3d795e45bc883538.webm?t=1684870587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594340/extras/886beab18009e14b3d795e45bc883538.mp4?t=1684870587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> You have to make your way through abandoned houses and factories.<br></li><li> Fight alien invaders.<br></li><li> Look for secrets and ammunition.<br></li><li> Bypass traps.<br></li><li> Avoid aggressive aliens.<br></li><li> Defeat bosses.</li></ul> <br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique levels.<br></li><li> Responsive controls.<br></li><li> Detailed graphics and good optimization.<br></li><li> Intense battles.<br></li><li> Mystical surroundings.<br></li><li> Two endings.</li></ul>",
